{"seq":1,"slug":"creative-review-approval-workflow","title":"创意审批工作流与角色","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/marketing-creative-dam-aigc-production/creative-approval-flow/creative-review-approval-workflow","wordCount":2959,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"创意审批工作流与角色\">创意审批工作流与角色</h1><p>审批环节存在的理由不是流程仪式，而是责任归属。当一条广告因为宣称不实被监管处罚时，需要能回答&quot;谁在什么信息基础上批准了它&quot;。这个问题的答案不能是&quot;营销部门&quot;，必须落到一个具体的人、一次具体的审批动作、以及当时可见的证据快照。这一节定义审批工作流的角色模型、状态机与规则快照机制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-审批实例与责任主体\">核心概念：审批实例与责任主体</h2><p>审批的对象不是素材文件，而是&quot;某个版本的素材在某个市场投放&quot;这个组合。同一张图在德国可以投、在某些市场不能投，因此审批实例必须绑定（素材版本，市场）二元组，而不是只绑定素材。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  S[&quot;素材版本&lt;br/&gt;review_passed&quot;] --&gt; SUB[&quot;提交审批&lt;br/&gt;创建 ApprovalInstance&quot;]&#10;  SUB --&gt; PA[&quot;并行评审&lt;br/&gt;品牌 + 法务&quot;]&#10;  PA --&gt; BR{&quot;品牌评审&quot;}&#10;  PA --&gt; LR{&quot;法务评审&quot;}&#10;  BR --&gt;|通过| J{&quot;全部通过?&quot;}&#10;  LR --&gt;|通过| J&#10;  BR --&gt;|驳回| REJ[&quot;rejected&quot;]&#10;  LR --&gt;|驳回| REJ&#10;  J --&gt;|是| AP[&quot;approved&lt;br/&gt;记录规则快照与证据&quot;]&#10;  J --&gt;|否| W[&quot;等待剩余评审&quot;]&#10;  AP --&gt; EXP[&quot;可投放&lt;br/&gt;进入分发&quot;]&#10;  AP -.-&gt;|素材版本变更| INV[&quot;invalidated&lt;br/&gt;需重新审批&quot;]\">graph TD\n  S[\"素材版本&lt;br/&gt;review_passed\"] --&gt; SUB[\"提交审批&lt;br/&gt;创建 ApprovalInstance\"]\n  SUB --&gt; PA[\"并行评审&lt;br/&gt;品牌 + 法务\"]\n  PA --&gt; BR{\"品牌评审\"}\n  PA --&gt; LR{\"法务评审\"}\n  BR --&gt;|通过| J{\"全部通过?\"}\n  LR --&gt;|通过| J\n  BR --&gt;|驳回| REJ[\"rejected\"]\n  LR --&gt;|驳回| REJ\n  J --&gt;|是| AP[\"approved&lt;br/&gt;记录规则快照与证据\"]\n  J --&gt;|否| W[\"等待剩余评审\"]\n  AP --&gt; EXP[\"可投放&lt;br/&gt;进入分发\"]\n  AP -.-&gt;|素材版本变更| INV[\"invalidated&lt;br/&gt;需重新审批\"]</pre><p>四个状态 <code>pending_review</code>、<code>approved</code>、<code>rejected</code>、<code>invalidated</code> 是必要的，其中 <code>invalidated</code> 是最容易被遗漏但最重要的一个：审批通过之后素材被修改（哪怕只是换了一行文案），原审批就不再有效。缺了这个状态，系统会出现&quot;批准的是 A 版，投放的是 B 版&quot;这种最难追责的漏洞。</p>\n<h2 id=\"角色模型\">角色模型</h2><p>角色不是职位，而是<strong>签署权限的组合</strong>。一个人可以同时具备多个角色，但每个审批环节必须记录行使的是哪个角色的权限。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>角色</th>\n<th>签署对象</th>\n<th>关注的判定</th>\n<th>不可代签的理由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>创意负责人</td>\n<td>视觉与文案质量</td>\n<td>是否符合创意简报、是否达到质量基线</td>\n<td>需要理解创意意图</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>品牌负责人</td>\n<td>品牌资产使用</td>\n<td>Logo/字体/色彩/调性是否符合规范</td>\n<td>承担品牌一致性责任</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>法务/合规</td>\n<td>宣称与法规</td>\n<td>宣称是否有证据、是否触发禁用条款</td>\n<td>承担法律责任</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>市场负责人</td>\n<td>市场适配</td>\n<td>本地表达、价格、促销条件是否正确</td>\n<td>承担市场后果</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>投放运营</td>\n<td>投放可行性</td>\n<td>规格是否匹配、落地页是否就绪</td>\n<td>承担执行后果</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>角色与市场的映射需要显式配置。法务角色通常按司法辖区划分——一个能签美国市场的法务不该默认能签欧盟市场：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE approver_scope (&#10;  approver_id  bigint NOT NULL,&#10;  role         text NOT NULL CHECK (role IN&#10;                 (&#39;creative_lead&#39;,&#39;brand_lead&#39;,&#39;legal&#39;,&#39;market_lead&#39;,&#39;ops&#39;)),&#10;  markets      text[] NOT NULL,&#10;  categories   text[] NOT NULL DEFAULT &#39;{}&#39;,&#10;  valid_from   date NOT NULL,&#10;  valid_to     date,&#10;  PRIMARY KEY (approver_id, role, valid_from)&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE TABLE approval_instance (&#10;  instance_id     bigserial PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  version_id      bigint NOT NULL REFERENCES asset_version(version_id),&#10;  market          text   NOT NULL,&#10;  channel         text,&#10;  status          text NOT NULL DEFAULT &#39;pending_review&#39;&#10;                    CHECK (status IN (&#39;pending_review&#39;,&#39;approved&#39;,&#39;rejected&#39;,&#39;invalidated&#39;)),&#10;  required_roles  text[] NOT NULL,&#10;  rule_snapshot   jsonb  NOT NULL,&#10;  evidence_snapshot jsonb NOT NULL DEFAULT &#39;{}&#39;::jsonb,&#10;  created_at      timestamptz NOT NULL DEFAULT now(),&#10;  decided_at      timestamptz,&#10;  invalidated_at  timestamptz,&#10;  invalidated_reason text&#10;);&#10;CREATE UNIQUE INDEX approval_active_unique&#10;  ON approval_instance (version_id, coalesce(market,&#39;&#39;), coalesce(channel,&#39;&#39;))&#10;  WHERE status = &#39;approved&#39;;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> approver_scope</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  approver_id  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bigint</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  role</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">role</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                 (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'creative_lead'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'brand_lead'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'legal'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'market_lead'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ops'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  markets      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  categories   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '{}'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  valid_from   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">date</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  valid_to     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (approver_id, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">role</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, valid_from)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> approval_instance</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  instance_id     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bigserial</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  version_id      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bigint</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> asset_version(version_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  market          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  channel         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">          text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'pending_review'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                    CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'pending_review'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'approved'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'rejected'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'invalidated'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  required_roles  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  rule_snapshot   jsonb  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  evidence_snapshot jsonb </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '{}'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::jsonb,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  created_at      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">timestamptz</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  decided_at      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">timestamptz</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  invalidated_at  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">timestamptz</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  invalidated_reason </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> UNIQUE INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> approval_active_unique</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> approval_instance (version_id, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">coalesce</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(market,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">''</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">coalesce</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(channel,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">''</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'approved'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>最后这条部分唯一索引保证了&quot;同一版本同一市场最多只有一份生效的批准&quot;，同时允许历史上存在多份被作废的批准记录。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规则快照-为什么审批必须绑定当时的规则\">规则快照：为什么审批必须绑定当时的规则</h2><p>法规会变。一个在规则 A 下批准的素材，在规则 A 被修订之后是否还需要重审？答案是需要，但如果审批记录里只存了&quot;通过&quot;两个字，系统无法知道当时依据的是哪版规则，也就无法在规则变更时准确地圈出需要重审的素材。</p>\n<p>规则变更的节奏不是假设性的。以欧盟 AI 法案为例，其第 50 条的透明度义务（对生成合成内容的机器可读标记，以及对深度伪造的披露）自 2026 年 8 月 2 日起适用 <a href=\"https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/50/\">EU AI Act Article 50</a>。这意味着在此之前批准的素材，如果含 AI 生成成分且目标市场在欧盟，在新规生效日之后必须重新校验——系统必须能按&quot;批准时间 + 目标市场 + 是否含 AI 成分&quot;精确圈出这批素材，而这恰恰依赖规则快照。</p>\n<p>因此审批通过时必须写入规则快照：当时的禁用词表版本、必须证据清单版本、市场渲染规则版本、以及素材在那一刻的内容指纹。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;instance_id&quot;: 20481,&#10;  &quot;version_id&quot;: 55120,&#10;  &quot;market&quot;: &quot;DE&quot;,&#10;  &quot;rule_snapshot&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;claim_rule_set&quot;: &quot;eu-de-v14&quot;,&#10;    &quot;claim_rule_hash&quot;: &quot;sha256:9f2c...&quot;,&#10;    &quot;required_evidence&quot;: [&quot;price_comparison_basis&quot;, &quot;eco_claim_certificate&quot;],&#10;    &quot;market_render_rule_version&quot;: &quot;de-2026-03&quot;,&#10;    &quot;forbidden_terms_version&quot;: &quot;de-v31&quot;&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;evidence_snapshot&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;price_comparison_basis&quot;: { &quot;ref&quot;: &quot;pricing://baseline/2026-Q3&quot;, &quot;verified_at&quot;: &quot;2026-09-20&quot; },&#10;    &quot;eco_claim_certificate&quot;: { &quot;ref&quot;: &quot;docs://certs/eco-2026-118.pdf&quot;, &quot;expires&quot;: &quot;2027-04-01&quot; }&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;content_digest&quot;: &quot;sha256:41ab...&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"instance_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20481</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"version_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">55120</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"market\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"DE\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"rule_snapshot\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"claim_rule_set\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"eu-de-v14\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"claim_rule_hash\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"sha256:9f2c...\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"required_evidence\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"price_comparison_basis\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"eco_claim_certificate\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"market_render_rule_version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"de-2026-03\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"forbidden_terms_version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"de-v31\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"evidence_snapshot\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"price_comparison_basis\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"ref\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"pricing://baseline/2026-Q3\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"verified_at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-09-20\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"eco_claim_certificate\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"ref\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"docs://certs/eco-2026-118.pdf\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"expires\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2027-04-01\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"content_digest\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"sha256:41ab...\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>content_digest</code> 是版本内容与渲染参数的联合指纹。当素材被重新导出（比如更换了透明通道处理），若字节不同但语义相同，用内容指纹判失效会产生大量假重审。实践中的折中是：指纹基于<strong>语义层</strong>（文案文本、图层结构、素材引用）而不是最终字节，这样只重编码不触发重审，改了文案才触发。</p>\n<h3 id=\"指纹的组成与计算时机\">指纹的组成与计算时机</h3><p>指纹必须在审批<strong>通过时</strong>计算并固化，而不是在分发时重算。原因是一旦在分发时重算，任何一次素材的等价重导出都会让指纹变化，分发被拒；而通过时固化的指纹给了&quot;审批时的内容状态&quot;一个稳定锚点，分发时的比对是一个明确的相等性检验。</p>\n<p>指纹的语义层组成通常包含三类：文案字段的规范化文本、图层结构的序列化描述、以及引用的素材资产版本 ID 集合。规范化是关键——去掉首尾空白、统一换行、折叠连续空格，这些处理让&quot;只是编辑时多打了一个换行&quot;不会触发重审。</p>\n<h3 id=\"规则快照与实际判定的一致性\">规则快照与实际判定的一致性</h3><p>规则快照记录了审批依据的规则版本，但还有一层容易忽略的校验：<strong>审批通过之后、分发之前，规则快照对应的规则是否已经失效</strong>。这需要定期比对当前生效的规则与历史实例引用的规则版本。比对的产物是一份待重审清单：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"SELECT i.instance_id, i.version_id, i.market, i.decided_at,&#10;       i.rule_snapshot-&gt;&gt;&#39;claim_rule_set&#39;   AS rule_set,&#10;       i.rule_snapshot-&gt;&gt;&#39;claim_rule_hash&#39;  AS old_hash,&#10;       c.current_hash&#10;  FROM approval_instance i&#10;  JOIN current_rule_hash c&#10;    ON c.rule_set_id = i.rule_snapshot-&gt;&gt;&#39;claim_rule_set&#39;&#10; WHERE i.status = &#39;approved&#39;&#10;   AND i.rule_snapshot-&gt;&gt;&#39;claim_rule_hash&#39; IS DISTINCT FROM c.current_hash&#10; ORDER BY i.decided_at;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> i</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">instance_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">i</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">version_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">i</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">market</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">i</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">decided_at</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       i</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">rule_snapshot</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">->></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'claim_rule_set'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rule_set,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       i</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">rule_snapshot</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">->></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'claim_rule_hash'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> old_hash,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">current_hash</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> approval_instance i</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> current_rule_hash c</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">rule_set_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> i</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">rule_snapshot</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">->></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'claim_rule_set'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> i</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'approved'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> i</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">rule_snapshot</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">->></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'claim_rule_hash'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DISTINCT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">current_hash</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> i</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">decided_at</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这份清单驱动的是 <code>needs_review</code> 而不是 <code>invalidated</code>——素材内容没变，只是依据的规则变了，因此可以保留原审批人与证据，只重审因规则变化而受影响的部分。</p>\n<h2 id=\"并行与串行的取舍\">并行与串行的取舍</h2><p>品牌评审与法务评审通常可以并行：两者关注的维度不重叠，串行只会拉长周期。但有两类情况必须串行：</p>\n<p><strong>第一，法务结论影响品牌判断。</strong> 如果法务判定某个宣称不可用，品牌评审就需要基于改写后的版本重做。此时应当先法务后品牌。这可以通过在审批规则里声明依赖来表达：<code>depends_on: [&quot;legal&quot;]</code>。</p>\n<p><strong>第二，证据缺失导致评审无法进行。</strong> 宣称需要证据而证据未上传时，法务评审应当处于 <code>blocked</code> 而不是 <code>pending</code>——两者的区别在于后者会被超时提醒，前者不会，因为没有意义。</p>\n<h3 id=\"依赖的表达与传播\">依赖的表达与传播</h3><p>依赖是任务级而非实例级的：同一实例内，一部分任务阻塞另一部分。表达依赖用 <code>depends_on</code> 数组即可，但只存下来是不够的，还要有传播——当一个任务被驳回时，依赖它的任务应当自动失效，否则审校员会继续处理一批注定要作废的任务。</p>\n<p>依赖传播在两个时机触发：任务被驳回时，把依赖它的所有未完成任务置为 <code>canceled</code>；任务被批准时，检查依赖它的任务是否可以从未阻塞转为待办。这两步都在审批任务的写入事务内完成，避免出现中间态。</p>\n<h3 id=\"不引入通用的工作流引擎\">不引入通用的工作流引擎</h3><p>审批是有向无环图上的状态传播，很容易让人想到引入通用工作流引擎。不引入的理由是：审批的图结构极浅（通常两三层）、节点类型极少（批准/驳回/阻塞）、且需要与素材领域模型紧耦合（规则快照、内容指纹都不是通用概念）。引入通用引擎会带来独立的运维面、状态存储与调试工具，而它解决的问题（复杂编排、长事务、补偿）在这里并不存在。</p>\n<p>判断标准很直接：当图深度需要条件分支、并行汇聚与人工干预的任意组合时，才值得引入引擎；审批通常停留在&quot;两三个固定角色加一条依赖边&quot;的量级。</p>\n<p>审批的时效需要显式管理。无期限的 pending 会让素材静静地卡住，运营以为在审批、审批人以为没提交。因此每条评审任务都有 SLA 与超时升级：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE approval_task (&#10;  task_id      bigserial PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  instance_id  bigint NOT NULL REFERENCES approval_instance(instance_id),&#10;  role         text NOT NULL,&#10;  assignee_id  bigint,&#10;  status       text NOT NULL DEFAULT &#39;pending&#39;&#10;                 CHECK (status IN (&#39;pending&#39;,&#39;blocked&#39;,&#39;approved&#39;,&#39;rejected&#39;,&#39;escalated&#39;)),&#10;  depends_on   text[] NOT NULL DEFAULT &#39;{}&#39;,&#10;  due_at       timestamptz NOT NULL,&#10;  escalated_at timestamptz,&#10;  decided_at   timestamptz&#10;);&#10;CREATE INDEX approval_task_due ON approval_task (status, due_at)&#10;  WHERE status IN (&#39;pending&#39;,&#39;blocked&#39;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> approval_task</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  task_id      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bigserial</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  instance_id  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bigint</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> approval_instance(instance_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  role</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  assignee_id  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bigint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'pending'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                 CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'pending'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'blocked'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'approved'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'rejected'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'escalated'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  depends_on   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '{}'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  due_at       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">timestamptz</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  escalated_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">timestamptz</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  decided_at   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">timestamptz</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> approval_task_due</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> approval_task (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">status</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, due_at)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'pending'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'blocked'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>升级动作不是自动批准，而是通知上一级并打上 <code>escalated</code> 标记——自动批准等于取消审批，这是不可接受的，因为它把责任从人转移到了一个超时配置上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"审批与生成阶段的分工\">审批与生成阶段的分工</h2><p>第 2 章的人工审校与本章的审批容易混淆，两者的分工必须清晰：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>环节</th>\n<th>判断的问题</th>\n<th>判断依据</th>\n<th>失败后果</th>\n<th>责任方</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>人工审校</td>\n<td>这个素材本身做得好不好</td>\n<td>质量基线、品牌规范、模板</td>\n<td>返工重生成</td>\n<td>创意与品牌团队</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>审批</td>\n<td>这个素材能不能在这个市场投</td>\n<td>法规、宣称证据、市场政策</td>\n<td>罚款、下架、诉讼</td>\n<td>法务与市场负责人</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>混淆的表现是把法规判断放进审校（审校员不是法务，判不准也不该承担这个责任），或者把质量判断放进审批（法务不该为&quot;这张图不够好看&quot;负责）。这个分工应当体现在系统的状态字段上：审校通过只把版本推进到 <code>review_passed</code>，审批通过才推进到可投放。</p>\n<h2 id=\"生效与失效的传播\">生效与失效的传播</h2><p>审批通过之后，需要把&quot;可投放&quot;这个信息传播到下游。传播有推拉两种设计：</p>\n<p><strong>拉模式</strong>是在分发环节实时查询审批状态（见 <a href=\"asset-publish-channel-distribute\">审批后多渠道分发</a> 的校验查询）。优点是永远读到最新状态，缺点是每次分发都要一次 join 与一次授权校验。</p>\n<p><strong>推模式</strong>是审批通过时更新资产的物化状态。优点是分发路径便宜，缺点是需要处理失效传播——当素材版本变更或规则快照过期时，必须把所有依赖该审批的分发记录也标记为待复核。</p>\n<p>实践中用推模式做主路径、拉模式做最后一道校验：物化状态用于批量筛选题材，最终推送前的单次校验走实时查询。这与 <a href=\"../creative-dam-model/asset-version-rights-license\">版本/版权/授权有效期管理</a> 里&quot;到期任务维护状态但读路径仍校验时间&quot;的策略同构，原因也一样——状态是缓存，判定依据才是真相。</p>\n<p>失效传播的实现是一条传播规则：素材版本变更 → 将该版本所有 <code>approved</code> 实例置为 <code>invalidated</code> 并写原因；规则快照的规则被修订 → 批量查询所有引用该规则版本的实例并置为 <code>needs_review</code>（不同于 <code>invalidated</code>，它可以保留原审批人信息并只重审变化的部分）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"UPDATE approval_instance&#10;   SET status = &#39;invalidated&#39;, invalidated_at = now(),&#10;       invalidated_reason = &#39;version_content_changed&#39;&#10; WHERE version_id = :changed_version_id AND status = &#39;approved&#39;;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> approval_instance</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   SET</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'invalidated'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, invalidated_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       invalidated_reason </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'version_content_changed'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> version_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :changed_version_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AND</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'approved'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这条语句与素材版本的写入必须在同一事务内，否则会存在&quot;版本已改但审批仍有效&quot;的窗口。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>审批对象是（素材版本，市场）组合，不是素材文件本身。</li>\n<li>四状态缺一不可，其中 <code>invalidated</code> 用来堵住&quot;批准 A 版投放 B 版&quot;的漏洞。</li>\n<li>角色是签署权限的组合，需要按市场配置作用域，法务权限尤其不能跨辖区默认。</li>\n<li>审批通过必须写规则快照与内容指纹，这是规则变更后准确圈定重审范围的前提。</li>\n<li>内容指纹基于语义层而非最终字节，避免重编码触发假重审。</li>\n<li>品牌与法务并行、法务与品牌有条件串行；阻塞与待办状态要区分，超时升级不等于自动批准。</li>\n<li>审校判&quot;好不好&quot;，审批判&quot;能不能投&quot;，责任方不同，状态字段必须分开。</li>\n<li>失效传播与版本变更同事务，避免出现审批有效的窗口。</li>\n<li>宣称校验的具体规则见 <a href=\"ad-claim-brand-compliance\">广告宣称/品牌合规校验</a>；通过后的推进见 <a href=\"asset-publish-channel-distribute\">审批后多渠道分发</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"创意审批工作流与角色","id":"创意审批工作流与角色"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：审批实例与责任主体","id":"核心概念-审批实例与责任主体"},{"level":2,"text":"角色模型","id":"角色模型"},{"level":2,"text":"规则快照：为什么审批必须绑定当时的规则","id":"规则快照-为什么审批必须绑定当时的规则"},{"level":3,"text":"指纹的组成与计算时机","id":"指纹的组成与计算时机"},{"level":3,"text":"规则快照与实际判定的一致性","id":"规则快照与实际判定的一致性"},{"level":2,"text":"并行与串行的取舍","id":"并行与串行的取舍"},{"level":3,"text":"依赖的表达与传播","id":"依赖的表达与传播"},{"level":3,"text":"不引入通用的工作流引擎","id":"不引入通用的工作流引擎"},{"level":2,"text":"审批与生成阶段的分工","id":"审批与生成阶段的分工"},{"level":2,"text":"生效与失效的传播","id":"生效与失效的传播"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"人工审校与品牌一致性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/marketing-creative-dam-aigc-production/aigc-creative-production/human-review-brand-guard"},"next":{"title":"广告宣称/品牌合规校验","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/marketing-creative-dam-aigc-production/creative-approval-flow/ad-claim-brand-compliance"}}